      "type": "update",
      "topic": "Windows Automation",
      "content": "PowerShell execution policy 2026: Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope CurrentUser cho phép chạy local script không cần admin privileges. Bypass cho session riêng: powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File script.ps1. NonInteractive flag: ngăn PowerShell prompt trong background scripts. Kiểm tra policy hiện tại: Get-ExecutionPolicy -List. RemoteSigned: local scripts run без signature, downloaded scripts cần signature.",
      "source": "windows_automation_protocol | web: netwrix, reddit r/PowerShell",
      "lang": "vi",
      "source_type": "knowledge",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T22:36:04.731148+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "3bcd786d8930779cf5cc39f5e0cf2855"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "Windows Automation",
      "content": "Task Scheduler 2026: chọn 'Run whether user is logged on or not' để script chạy background không cần người dùng login. Để chạy script .ps1: tạo task → Action 'Start a program' → program: powershell.exe, arguments: -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File 'C:\\path\\script.ps1'. Trigger: time-based (daily/weekly) hoặc event-based (logon, system start, event ID từ Event Viewer). Điều kiện: uncheck 'Start only if on AC power' nếu dùng laptop.",
      "source": "windows_automation_protocol | web: netwrix, stackoverflow, superuser",
      "lang": "vi",
      "source_type": "knowledge",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T22:36:04.731148+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "d1387495a545c1038669f114d99fbf00"
    },
    {
